{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "0d4fc84ca8e6589285e8578a8bef170f4f09fe0b9e505e2a7da916dbc178afa2", "ja": "リメンバー！", "zh": "Remember！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b78eee8e656ce4955dc1cea02e09d235688853242856efaad7a7909c7b483087", "ja": "ロコの様子を気にする育とエレナ。その場に\n居合わせた杏奈、歌織と共に話しかけるが、\nみんなの共感を得られないと知ったロコは、\n部屋を飛び出していってしまう。何か企んで\nいる様子だが、果たして……？", "zh": "育和艾蕾娜十分在意ROCO的状态。她们和恰好在场的杏奈、歌织一起上前搭话，却得知无法得到大家共鸣的ROCO冲出房间离开了。看起来似乎在谋划什么，但究竟……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6296a9a24cabc1bcc7e54fbb6d08e168aaf97e766f4a78ec58fbf4456dbedc76", "ja": "（天体公演を見据えたレッスンに立ち会っている。\n経過は順調だけど……やっぱりロコの元気がないな）", "zh": "（我正在旁观为天体公演做准备的练习。进展很顺利，不过……果然ROCO还是没什么精神啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1001_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "fa34509bad1d5d704c24007e4c48cfe74c3dc2266e5c22a093180a78688e388f", "ja": "お疲れさま、です……。\nえと……レッスン、交代の時間、だよ……？", "zh": "辛苦了……  \n那个……该轮换练习了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "18cab8ecfbc8b096dc68887a73376e9d52f546c3085869648158c4e1106928b0", "ja": "おっと、もうそんなに経ってたか……。\nじゃあ片付けようか、3人とも。", "zh": "哦，已经过了这么久啊……那就一起收拾吧，3个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "e9f44cc864432974e0f08090f2105f89859074f3789e929fdf812fe12247afed", "ja": "ウン！　アンナ、カオリ、ごめんネ～！\nすぐに片づけるから、待ってて！", "zh": "嗯！安娜、歌织，不好意思啦～！\n我马上就收拾，等我一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "a6e50ad535294fb8ffd32df3d5afd11ddfd819abd52a2cc0980544a2ce27d099", "ja": "急がないで、ゆっくりでいいから。\nそれよりみんな、もう対談してきたんですって？", "zh": "不用着急，慢慢来就好。\n比起那个，听说大家已经去对谈过了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "d40b4a889ef112fd4f7032e750fe790d64db0b45c589bc3f3530226b32f4fc4a", "ja": "あ、それ、杏奈も聞きました……。\nヨルノオルカさんと……対談してきた、って……。", "zh": "啊，这个杏奈也听说了……。\n和夜之虎鲸小姐……进行访谈了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "88955a31df085fcf4508948ca63f3abd7d2ae1987f8fbca61be3d1485f96e0eb", "ja": "うん、いっぱいお話してきたよ！\nすっごくいい人で、楽しかった♪", "zh": "嗯，聊了好多好多呢！\n人特别好，可开心了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "c3e0552dad6307045728c7feed6db95219bdb3d862a0e4189ba47df3437565d5", "ja": "いいな、羨ましい……。\nでも……ロコは、どうしたの？　元気ない、ね……。", "zh": "真好啊，好羡慕……\n可是……ROCO是怎么了？好像没什么精神，呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d5129891c30bf1f96dfb02d3bdf554827c3c9c51cd2dd86949bcfeac6d424be2", "ja": "実は対談から帰ってきて、ずっとあんな調子なんだ。\nどこか、上の空っていうか……。", "zh": "其实从对谈回来之后，她就一直是一副那样的状态。\n总觉得有些心不在焉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "c3eb5762ef15f98f5b22cb13b98bf202f99356035cbbb2e2137696aa5edd80e7", "ja": "そうなんだヨー！　レッスン中もずっとだし、\nワタシも、どうしたのか気になってたノ。", "zh": "原来是这样呀——！她在训练时也一直那样，我也一直很在意她到底是怎么了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "b1a95b5d11700162897c5d822ffd6a646fe85872f9011f7e4adf2f17990ba865", "ja": "うん、ロコちゃん、\n「ノープロブレムです！」としか言わないし……。", "zh": "嗯，ROCO也只会说“没问题！”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "7734f1ece5a71b4b00b4f7e19184b58090e399c343ac1184a3194b5dc4a039f5", "ja": "あら、ちょっと気がかりね……。\n対談で、何か思うところあったのかしら？", "zh": "哎呀，稍微有点让人在意呢……\n难道是对谈时有什么想法吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "be1f034d610d3cc1d704640bdfa2f37cfc8ec271fce5db088945cbc5522c82f6", "ja": "ん……ロコ、ちょっといい？", "zh": "嗯……ROCO，方便聊一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "b81321801ae12e075535f1fd25a96dbde248987f3f7f0ad52f74bcf4576ac33c", "ja": "はっ、アンナ……どうしましたか？\nロコはノープロブレムですけど……！", "zh": "啊，杏奈……有什么事吗？\nROCO没问题，不过……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "6bc63e1f15525d2c1147dcb1402792e88750d091898dbce921be206a32333168", "ja": "ロコは、ヨルノオルカさんのファン、でしょ？\n対談、嬉しかったんじゃない、の……？", "zh": "ROCO是夜之虎鲸小姐的粉丝，对吧？\n能进行对谈，你应该很开心吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "3b6894401d82498dbdc41bf239d3447b87998ce1bc1603afed43ffa050c1d82e", "ja": "えっ。アンナに話したこと、ありましたっけ？", "zh": "咦？我有跟杏奈说过这件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "f4b1069c52a1f2a4a26f531a4b03d6d0a60c210cabd04f79ac683738fc4ed5ae", "ja": "ううん……でも、わかる、よ……。\n杏奈も、ファンだから……。", "zh": "嗯……但是，我明白……的。\n因为杏奈也是粉丝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "a588b64a6e0a71167c920edcaa80f1bd16452c186b24f79169590d2cd39d0326", "ja": "『Q』の頃から聞いてるし……ああいう感じ、\nロコもきっと好きだろうな、って、思ってた……。", "zh": "从『Q』那时候起杏奈就在听了……就觉得，\n那种感觉，ROCO肯定也会喜欢吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "8fc2edb9c5bbf7819fab7b951ba009f60384916e9e3a6a6a3436fb5052c347ff", "ja": "あ、アンナも、『Q』の頃から！？", "zh": "啊，杏奈也是从《Q》的时候就开始听了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "87b7205aa5200650b1c5d5ebfd968f779673e9b6d5ac5368d3ceb064d96bfaf8", "ja": "ん……。対談、すっごく羨ましかった……。\nできれば……代わってほしいって、思うくらい……。", "zh": "嗯……那次对谈，杏奈超级羡慕的……\n甚至觉得……要是能换成杏奈就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "2829577c36e83f5162ae17597ffd60f51b1a04e5e971fe948402db3edab40fff", "ja": "へぇ、そこまでか……。\n杏奈にも声掛けたらよかったな。ゴメン。", "zh": "哦，有那么羡慕吗……\n早知道也该叫上杏奈了。抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "cad1990ae5e1e353bb210797bc4c61a6b4f2310d7b322a7bf0e167e735240944", "ja": "大丈夫、です。次、チャンスがあったらで……。\nそれより、ロコ……何があったの？", "zh": "没关系的。下次有机会再说吧……\n比起那个，ROCO……发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "bdfdd1704ab5fb69dfbe837ddcd250ec1c7e9af1441e4ca58a7df0e7e4122726", "ja": "そ、それは……。\nうぅ……ロコは、ロコは……！", "zh": "那、那是……  \n呜呜……ROCO，ROCO……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1025_025roc", "source_sha256": "68a81826316c84087cdd346212dc2f826bd5c11b0cbaa47746c5063c4a0055a7", "ja": "すごく、ショックだったんです！\nあの『Q』が、アートソウルを失っていたなんて！", "zh": "真的让我大受打击！\n没想到那个『Q』竟然失去了艺术灵魂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "f5f18e70816460a55e2ba42a68e6c29401c03dffb9f28f7ca386236d8a8e2716", "ja": "アートソウル……？\nもしかして、作風が変わっちゃったって話かな？", "zh": "艺术灵魂……？\n难道是说，画风已经变了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1027_025roc", "source_sha256": "d84a469f19a4b8c283f48cadef702c5284fe000d8893e5c043b8308be40ef750", "ja": "イグザクトリーです！　昔に比べると、\n最近はインダストリアルな作品が増えてしまって……。", "zh": "完全正确！和过去相比，最近工业风的作品变多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1028_025roc", "source_sha256": "dc8e1fd5fe2bb6b7effd25b3c87f94ef8bf5e92d00af23662cd31918d754388f", "ja": "もどかしいんです～！\nあの人は、もっと凄いアートを作れるのに……！", "zh": "太让人着急了～！\n那个人明明能做出更惊艳的艺术作品的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1029_052kao", "source_sha256": "50849108b1b3d0d5368d8346ac119934e0b4a099069ce43e04e2f048120d785f", "ja": "ねえ杏奈ちゃん、その人って、\nロコちゃんの言う通り、そんなに変わっちゃったの？", "zh": "呐，杏奈，那个人真的像ROCO说的那样，变了那么多吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1030_024ann", "source_sha256": "0d03cd6ac21f8cfdc956a60a40a4b7803ea142a9a99de11a7ca93e251b10ce8a", "ja": "んと……。\nたしかに、そういう意見……結構、あります。", "zh": "嗯……\n确实……有挺多这种意见的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1031_025roc", "source_sha256": "76a7eeeac223afe1202bcccd773320811426e1534898953320305f042cc9b0ea", "ja": "エブリワン、アンダースタンドですよ！\nファンなら誰だってそう思います！", "zh": "大家，都明白了吧！\n只要是粉丝，谁都会这么想！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1032_025roc", "source_sha256": "8350f99daef20419d1ae5272d2efe998256f2cd85c76f51fa1a6431c1e54e1f2", "ja": "フリーダムで、オリジナリティ溢れる世界があって\nこそ、あの人の作品はアトラクティブになるんです！", "zh": "正因为有自由、充满独创性的世界，那个人的作品才会更有魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1033_025roc", "source_sha256": "8e427e1599c70d598a9ece660c9c251d500b21c3da29afb9cf20648141dfa669", "ja": "イクだって、そう思いましたよね！？\n昔の曲の方が、クールだって！", "zh": "罗可也这么想的吧！？\n老歌才更酷，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1034_030iku", "source_sha256": "8d830d7ed5dd453b5bb1fc62857fd31207071cada9f60c09158d7ecb9caae164", "ja": "そ、そうなのかな？\nわたし、全部はまだ聞いてないし……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？\n我还没把全部都听过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1035_030iku", "source_sha256": "c7b54e90a5e5e1df6eda81b034875969df7aea1eb5b1796b8f4d9db9e1fd68c5", "ja": "それに、今やってるアニメの曲のほうが好きかも？　\nだって明るくて、元気になれるもん！", "zh": "而且，我可能更喜欢现在正在播的动画主题曲吧？\n因为它很明快，能让人打起精神来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1036_025roc", "source_sha256": "be8a1c3c62b52877a9e17981d2e8ba3eac80fc0ba0f46bd21c9404ce3389ed10", "ja": "う、うぐぐ……！　で、でも、\nあの人のリアルパワーは、そんなものじゃなくて……！", "zh": "呜、呜呜……！可、可是，那个人的真正实力可不止这些……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1037_024ann", "source_sha256": "b54230edd97b25c7464132bdbb1b6056d3e651c254746bde87b10748b336aa05", "ja": "杏奈も、最近の曲も……結構、好き。\nゲームの主題歌、歌ってて……。", "zh": "杏奈也……最近的歌也……挺喜欢。  \n还唱过游戏的主题曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1038_024ann", "source_sha256": "b333f696dd1fa246d39a895345712ceb648cd7f779e1f35e788892e76483a0cd", "ja": "毎回、曲が聞きたくて……オープニングが、\n飛ばせない……。ずっと、リピートしちゃう……。", "zh": "每次都想听那首歌……连开场动画都舍不得跳过……总是忍不住一直循环播放……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1039_018ele", "source_sha256": "b004a27e739fe24abfed6af23a3225b0a4f72527b36c83690a03513267f80fbd", "ja": "それって、最新の動画のだよネ？\nダンサブルな曲で、ワタシも大好きだヨ♪", "zh": "那是最新视频里的歌吧？\n是首很有舞蹈感的歌，我也最喜欢了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1040_052kao", "source_sha256": "53a0729bb609e1b8d788f291d0a2b05d804593ee5c84887ec9a6e59c523b9a23", "ja": "ええと、それって……。\nあった、公式サイトの……この曲かしら？", "zh": "那个……也就是说……\n找到了，是官网上的……这首歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1041_p", "source_sha256": "91a7ec8c5918dade1d1664b61d8b12c0072b0e6bde118bfa17ff103784337210", "ja": "あ、それですね！　凄い再生数ですよね……。", "zh": "啊，是这个！播放量真惊人啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1042_052kao", "source_sha256": "7cde6a888ca8fc09afce987c3108d8f0b7a6a3f64e50afe73923a626881030c5", "ja": "まぁ。ゲームの主題歌とか、ドラマのオープニングまで\n歌っているの？　ずいぶん幅広い方なのね……。", "zh": "哎呀。连游戏的主题曲、电视剧的片头曲\n都唱过吗？涉猎的范围还真广呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1043_052kao", "source_sha256": "7f7c77958c179c8b95effee997a0ee19bc8a7f8ceb29a0e984e5c7fe420d383e", "ja": "あっ、この曲なら知ってます！\n何かと聞くタイミングがあって、耳に残っちゃって。", "zh": "啊，这首歌我知道！\n之前偶尔有机会听到，结果一直在耳边挥之不去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1044_030iku", "source_sha256": "196f105383122544b097d11b945dd729dc2377341f291be551a9a06a46b418e0", "ja": "うん！　すっごくいい曲だよね♪\n環ちゃんと桃子ちゃんも、大好きだって言ってたよ！", "zh": "嗯！这首歌真的超棒吧♪\n小环和桃子也说她们最喜欢了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1045_025roc", "source_sha256": "8a30c8d7d76bcd7bab42c41df853d3ae1e8e599964eaf26bd439a0308a25d202", "ja": "み、みんな……ダメです！\nポピュラーであればいいわけじゃないんですよ！", "zh": "大、大家……不行！不是流行就够了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1046_025roc", "source_sha256": "e4f8b9338c64f40944b2d4c35ce9f8bfee46c778171aef3155f2fe201a39a6c9", "ja": "ヨルノオルカの実力が発揮されるのは、\nもっとインディビジュアルな……う、うぐぐぐっ！", "zh": "夜海海豚真正发挥实力的时候，应该更加独特……呜、呜咕咕咕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1047_025roc", "source_sha256": "4d0c01a82ca88e80d8f58a738a42e83ec577f1d95427255aa89a9b9a7de55dda", "ja": "こ、こうなったら！\nエブリワン、リメンバーです～～～～っ！", "zh": "那、那就这样吧！大家，要记住哦～～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1048_se", "source_sha256": "a013a2841d1e08b03e0b2536c89df33010b4e1c6115d1ccf0b349a2070cfeef8", "ja": "ガチャ、バタンッ！　ダダダダダ……！", "zh": "扭蛋，砰！哒哒哒哒哒……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1049_p", "source_sha256": "1209e2dc3fcf44fb5cb90d87f98f59e28598ad8e8456b79cd8be0483bb4c119c", "ja": "あっ。ロコ！？　ロコーッ！", "zh": "啊。ROCO！？ROCO——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_03_1050_p", "source_sha256": "9f8599e9dc3d05d026d4d759598413251af5b4df301ef92a9c99acf0a8751b34", "ja": "（捨て台詞のようなものを残して、\nロコは走り去った……一体何をする気なんだ？）", "zh": "（留下了一句像是临走前放下的狠话，ROCO便跑掉了……她到底打算做什么？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
